WEBVTT

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.167
By the power of the Tree of Ages,
I now return to this world!

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.292
What is happening?

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:29.625
MEI HIGURASHI    TOWA HIGURASHI

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:30.750
MEI HIGURASHI    TOWA HIGURASHI
What is...

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.708
Sis.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:33.458
This smell.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.125
Mei!

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.708
Oh, how strange.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.708
Sis, what is that?

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:46.458
Could this smell be...

00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:00.042
- Wha...
- Oh, dear.

00:01:00.042 --> 00:01:02.083
That's... That's...

00:01:02.917 --> 00:01:07.583
Yes! That unbelievably bright place
from my memories...

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:08.958
And this smell!

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:10.292
Setsuna!

00:01:10.292 --> 00:01:11.542
DEMON SLAYER - SETSUNA
Setsuna!

00:01:11.542 --> 00:01:14.125
DEMON SLAYER - SETSUNA
Wh-Who calls my name?

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.833
BOUNTY HUNTER - MOROHA
Damn it. I feel so weak.

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:20.500
Is it because I crossed through
the rainbow corridor?

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:26.583
Wonderful, just wonderful!

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:29.833
MISTRESS THREE-EYES
The Silver Pearl is here as well.

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:33.583
Now each of my three eyes
will have a pearl!

00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:36.417
Setsuna, I'll save you!

00:01:47.542 --> 00:01:51.708
No way! My Kikujumonji broke!

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:35.833
"The Dream Butterfly"

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:41.333
No way! My Kikujumonji broke!

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:46.042
Did you say Kikujumonji?
This is obviously a fake.

00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:49.250
The blade pattern's completely different!

00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:50.292
But...

00:03:50.375 --> 00:03:51.917
Give it to me.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.542
Give me the Silver Pearl!

00:03:57.208 --> 00:04:00.208
Give it to me now!

00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:01.375
My body won't...

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:03.958
"Silver" what?
What is she talking about?

00:04:04.375 --> 00:04:06.375
Give it to me!

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:08.833
How dare you break
my Kikujumonji...

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.667
How dare you do that to Setsuna!

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:14.958
What?

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:29.958
I can't believe it.

00:04:30.083 --> 00:04:33.208
She created a demon energy blade
with her own power.

00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:44.542
Wait, did I do this?

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:48.333
Hey! What are you doing?
Hurry up and finish her!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.250
I don't think that's possible...

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.000
This is not the time!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:55.375
Sis!

00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:02.125
You see?

00:05:02.542 --> 00:05:05.125
If you don't hurry up,
they'll get eaten!

00:05:06.417 --> 00:05:07.208
Mei!

00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:08.667
Mei!

00:05:21.583 --> 00:05:23.125
It's nothing personal.

00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:28.542
Th-Thank you...

00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:31.583
You saved us.
Thank you so much.

00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:33.000
No need to thank me.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.417
I'm sorry, Setsuna.

00:05:38.958 --> 00:05:40.917
How do you know my name?

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:43.208
Who are you?

00:05:43.667 --> 00:05:45.375
You don't remember me, Setsuna?

00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:49.750
It's me, Towa.
You used to call me Sis.

00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:56.125
Ugh, that was horrible.
I can finally move my body now.

00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:10.792
Hey, welcome back!

00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:20.542
Wait, what is that?

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:28.417
GRANDPA

00:06:28.417 --> 00:06:31.333
GRANDPA
This is kind of nostalgic, isn't it?

00:06:31.625 --> 00:06:34.000
GRAMMY
Yes. It reminds of the times

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.625
Inuyasha would come to visit Kagome.

00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:38.583
Indeed.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.625
Hey!

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:46.542
Hey, I can keep this, right?

00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:48.417
Do as you wish.

00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:52.125
All right! But man, what a trip.

00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:57.167
Where the heck are we?
This whole place is as bright as day.

00:06:57.625 --> 00:06:59.167
Setsuna, I'm sorry.

00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:02.042
It's my fault, isn't it?

00:07:02.042 --> 00:07:05.250
It's because I let go of you that day...

00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:08.625
That's why you're acting this way, right?

00:07:10.792 --> 00:07:11.958
Setsuna?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:17.042
I do not know you.
Don't come near me if you value your life.

00:07:17.417 --> 00:07:19.083
Take even one step, and...

00:07:20.167 --> 00:07:21.292
I'll kill you!

00:07:25.167 --> 00:07:26.083
What?

00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:31.667
Stop running!

00:07:31.667 --> 00:07:34.708
Hell no! You look like you're seriously
out to hurt me!

00:07:34.792 --> 00:07:35.792
That's because I am!

00:07:35.792 --> 00:07:38.875
Hey, cut it out, you two!

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:41.083
And Setsuna, stop acting like a kid.

00:07:41.083 --> 00:07:42.958
What's the harm in
letting her near you?

00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:44.083
Silence.

00:07:44.083 --> 00:07:45.833
My name's Moroha.

00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:50.250
My bounty hunter buddies call me
"Moroha the Demon Killer."

00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:52.375
What's your name?

00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:54.167
Towa Higurashi.

00:07:54.333 --> 00:07:58.333
Towa, huh? Okay, Towa!
Are you really Setsuna's sister?

00:07:58.417 --> 00:08:00.208
Of course I am!

00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:04.375
I got separated from her
in the forest fire ten years ago!

00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:05.542
So she says.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.500
I've been alone since birth.

00:08:08.833 --> 00:08:12.875
Oh yeah? But you're both half-demons.

00:08:15.042 --> 00:08:19.333
See, I can tell just from
your demon energy.

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:21.875
Isn't that right, half-demon "Setsu"?

00:08:23.583 --> 00:08:28.083
Plus, why else would a Rainbow Pearl
dwell inside your eye?

00:08:28.792 --> 00:08:31.375
Which makes you
a half-demon, too, Towa.

00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:33.417
What's a "half-demon"?

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.917
A half-demon is someone born
between a demon and a human.

00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:39.958
You two share
really similar demon energy.

00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:44.667
Even if you're the child
of a great demon,

00:08:44.667 --> 00:08:47.083
having human blood halves your powers.

00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:51.125
I'm guessing that's what
bothers Setsu the most.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:58.167
And if I'm not mistaken, your dad's
the great demon Sesshomaru.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.542
Is that right?

00:08:59.542 --> 00:09:01.375
What? Who is that?

00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:02.458
Well?

00:09:02.458 --> 00:09:05.583
Don't know. Never met him.

00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:09.375
Setsuna is the daughter of Sesshomaru?

00:09:09.875 --> 00:09:12.292
So she's a half-demon?

00:09:12.667 --> 00:09:15.375
No wonder she's so powerful.

00:09:15.792 --> 00:09:18.500
VILLAGE ELDER PRIESTESS - KAEDE
Fourteen years ago...

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:23.708
Sesshomaru came here
and took his newborn twins with him.

00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:28.500
That was the last I saw of them, until...

00:09:34.333 --> 00:09:37.833
One day, Setsuna came to me.

00:09:38.167 --> 00:09:42.917
She told me that it was
"a rite of courage and cowardice."

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.875
I'll be in your care for a while.

00:09:47.042 --> 00:09:47.250
LEADER OF DEMON SLAYERS - KOHAKU

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.000
LEADER OF DEMON SLAYERS - KOHAKU
"Rite of courage and cowardice"?

00:09:49.542 --> 00:09:52.958
A lion is said to push their cubs
into the bottomless ravine,

00:09:53.167 --> 00:09:58.292
and raise only the ones strong enough
to crawl back up on their own.

00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.833
It is known as the
rite of courage and cowardice.

00:10:01.958 --> 00:10:05.667
Is that what Sesshomaru
is doing to Setsuna?

00:10:05.958 --> 00:10:09.667
Perhaps, though I can't say for certain.

00:10:10.125 --> 00:10:14.500
Lord Sesshomaru used to help me a lot
back when I was a kid.

00:10:14.917 --> 00:10:20.750
But even then, it was difficult to
understand his true intentions.

00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:24.792
You said "twins." That means
there's another child out there?

00:10:24.792 --> 00:10:26.625
I wonder.

00:10:27.042 --> 00:10:29.250
Being uninformed half-demons,

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:35.750
it's very possible that she may have
already killed the other out of hate.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:36.542
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU - HISUI

00:10:36.542 --> 00:10:37.458
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU - HISUI
Oh, no.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:42.667
If you truly are my older sister,
then prove it to me with your strength.

00:10:42.833 --> 00:10:45.833
I don't need to prove anything,
because I'm not wrong!

00:10:45.833 --> 00:10:48.000
Empty words. They mean nothing.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.208
Come on, cut it out already!

00:10:51.208 --> 00:10:52.167
Be quiet.

00:10:52.292 --> 00:10:54.083
You're so stubborn!

00:10:54.083 --> 00:10:55.250
Shut up.

00:11:04.292 --> 00:11:05.250
Is that...

00:11:05.917 --> 00:11:06.917
Yup.

00:11:07.542 --> 00:11:09.875
The Hitokon chose its host.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.000
Geez, how pathetic.

00:11:15.292 --> 00:11:18.250
This is what happens
when you let your guard down!

00:11:23.542 --> 00:11:24.208
Towa?

00:11:24.208 --> 00:11:26.208
Stop it, Sis!

00:11:27.375 --> 00:11:29.958
That's not the Towa
you know and love anymore.

00:11:29.958 --> 00:11:32.292
You all should go hide somewhere!

00:11:32.292 --> 00:11:33.417
O-Okay.

00:11:33.417 --> 00:11:34.667
You too, Grandpa!

00:11:34.667 --> 00:11:36.250
A-All right.

00:11:37.833 --> 00:11:40.917
The Hitokon itself is nothing special,

00:11:41.208 --> 00:11:45.167
but the problem is,
it can control the powers of its host.

00:11:46.042 --> 00:11:48.833
Damn it, this is so annoying.

00:11:50.292 --> 00:11:52.250
She looks just like her.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.042
Just like who?

00:11:54.292 --> 00:11:57.875
Her eyes look just like Kagome's.

00:12:07.417 --> 00:12:08.667
Whoa!

00:12:09.375 --> 00:12:11.583
I see, interesting.

00:12:21.292 --> 00:12:24.042
So that's your demon power.

00:12:24.542 --> 00:12:27.667
Then I'll treat you as a worthy opponent.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:33.083
Get real, Setsuna.
Are you really going to kill your sister?

00:12:33.083 --> 00:12:36.333
Anyone who opposes me is
an enemy of mine.

00:12:37.417 --> 00:12:39.208
Cyclone Burst!

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:52.750
What?

00:13:10.625 --> 00:13:12.042
Do not interfere.

00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:13.250
Hey, Setsuna.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.875
You're a demon slayer, aren't you?

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:19.000
You should at least have
medicine to weaken the Hitokon.

00:13:34.167 --> 00:13:36.000
Scourge of Swallows!

00:13:53.667 --> 00:13:55.000
Sis!

00:13:55.333 --> 00:13:58.417
Are you okay? Wake up already!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.458
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:14:00.875 --> 00:14:01.750
Mei!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:02.667
Oh, no!

00:14:08.458 --> 00:14:09.167
Mei!

00:14:13.083 --> 00:14:14.292
- Mei?
- What?

00:14:14.583 --> 00:14:17.792
That bastard transferred over to the child.

00:14:19.125 --> 00:14:20.792
M-Mei.

00:14:25.708 --> 00:14:27.375
Mei, what's wrong?

00:14:27.375 --> 00:14:30.250
Is she being controlled? Get it together!

00:14:31.667 --> 00:14:33.250
Stay right there.

00:14:35.125 --> 00:14:38.375
You figured a child
would be easier to control.

00:14:38.458 --> 00:14:39.500
How foolish.

00:14:39.792 --> 00:14:41.333
Hey, what are you...

00:14:41.333 --> 00:14:44.875
Don't worry.
I will cut out the Hitokon.

00:14:45.292 --> 00:14:46.542
You can't!

00:14:48.458 --> 00:14:51.417
I won't let you scar Mei's face.

00:14:52.208 --> 00:14:53.125
Oh?

00:14:53.667 --> 00:14:58.625
I can't trouble this family
more than I already have!

00:14:59.792 --> 00:15:00.875
Such naiveté.

00:15:01.125 --> 00:15:02.542
What did you say?

00:15:10.458 --> 00:15:12.667
Mei. This is my fault...

00:15:12.833 --> 00:15:15.667
I'm so sorry, Mei.

00:15:17.042 --> 00:15:21.750
As long as you're alive,
you'll always trouble someone.

00:15:22.167 --> 00:15:23.917
Hey, stop it.

00:15:23.917 --> 00:15:24.917
Mei!

00:15:24.917 --> 00:15:26.042
It's fine.

00:15:26.583 --> 00:15:29.542
It'll be okay, Mei.

00:15:34.958 --> 00:15:36.708
Moon of the Resting Moth.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.875
Did you kill them?

00:15:57.875 --> 00:16:00.625
A resting moth's powder
only puts one to asleep.

00:16:02.375 --> 00:16:04.417
<i>Th-Thank you!</i>

00:16:06.042 --> 00:16:07.375
Right.

00:16:20.083 --> 00:16:23.583
So you <i>did </i>have some slayer potion!

00:16:24.333 --> 00:16:29.292
The Hitokon, huh?
The bounty for this one's pretty small.

00:16:29.292 --> 00:16:32.375
Well, maybe it'll be enough for lunch!

00:16:32.792 --> 00:16:34.125
What's wrong?

00:16:36.125 --> 00:16:44.000
So Mistress Three-Eyes, Setsuna,
and Moroha vanished near the Sacred Tree?

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.292
Indeed. Hisui, show Lady Kaede.

00:16:46.292 --> 00:16:50.792
Yes. I found this attached to
the root of the Sacred Tree.

00:16:51.542 --> 00:16:53.333
That's Root Head.

00:16:53.583 --> 00:16:58.042
It is, isn't it?
I knew I had seen it before.

00:16:58.417 --> 00:17:02.083
This is a demon we had slain
back when you were a baby.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:07.792
If Root Head really did attach itself to the Sacred Tree,
then this could be a problem.

00:17:08.583 --> 00:17:13.875
A demon tree's root can absorb
the powers of its host, right?.

00:17:14.208 --> 00:17:15.708
Like the Hitokon.

00:17:16.042 --> 00:17:22.042
Yes, but to attach itself to the
Tree of Ages, of all things...

00:17:22.125 --> 00:17:23.250
Tree of Ages?

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:28.042
I've heard of the Sacred Tree
being called the Tree of Ages.

00:17:28.042 --> 00:17:30.208
But why is that?

00:17:30.417 --> 00:17:34.792
Kohaku, you know about the
Bone Eater’s Well, don't you?

00:17:35.333 --> 00:17:40.750
Are you referring to the well that Lady Kagome
and Lord Inuyasha used to travel through?

00:17:41.042 --> 00:17:45.458
It's been over fifteen years
since it's become defunct...

00:17:45.708 --> 00:17:51.375
But according to Kagome, that well had
the power to travel across time.

00:17:51.625 --> 00:17:53.583
Travel across time?

00:17:53.583 --> 00:17:58.000
Kagome and Inuyasha simply described it
as going to "the other world."

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.583
The other world...

00:18:00.167 --> 00:18:04.250
That well was made using
wood from the Tree of Ages.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:09.000
And if Root Head was attached
to the Tree of Ages...

00:18:10.833 --> 00:18:14.083
It may have absorbed
the Tree of Ages' ability...

00:18:14.083 --> 00:18:18.417
...to cross into the other world.

00:18:19.125 --> 00:18:21.958
So Setsuna and the others
may have gone to...

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:26.958
To "Tokyo," the village
Kagome originally came from.

00:18:26.958 --> 00:18:30.542
Can they even come back
from a place like that?

00:18:31.042 --> 00:18:37.875
I'm afraid it would be no easy task.

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:47.667
Is Towa asleep?

00:18:47.667 --> 00:18:50.000
Yes. She said she was really tired.

00:18:50.208 --> 00:18:53.833
Things sure have taken an interesting turn.

00:18:53.958 --> 00:18:55.417
SOTA HIGURASHI

00:18:55.417 --> 00:18:57.375
SOTA HIGURASHI
I've told you about it before, didn't I?

00:18:57.375 --> 00:18:58.917
That demons were real.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:03.250
And I've always believed you,
so that's fine and all...

00:19:03.333 --> 00:19:06.500
But this Kikujumonji,
on the other hand...

00:19:06.708 --> 00:19:10.375
MOE HIGURASHI
This was on loan from the museum...

00:19:11.125 --> 00:19:12.000
What should we do?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.000
Daddy!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:17.042
What's done is done!
We'll just have to keep holding on to it.

00:19:17.042 --> 00:19:18.542
Mommy, listen.

00:19:19.042 --> 00:19:22.875
More importantly, what about Sis?
We had a lot of trouble out there.

00:19:22.875 --> 00:19:25.875
Sis really had some amazing powers.

00:19:25.875 --> 00:19:29.833
I'd be lying if I said I didn't know...

00:19:30.208 --> 00:19:32.167
Towa will be just fine.

00:19:32.167 --> 00:19:36.000
She's always been the center of chaos.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:40.583
The problem is actually those girls
who came from the other era, right?

00:19:41.583 --> 00:19:42.833
That felt great.

00:19:43.708 --> 00:19:47.833
I've never in my life
splashed hot water over my head.

00:19:48.042 --> 00:19:53.375
That's great. It's getting late,
so how about turning in for the night?

00:19:53.708 --> 00:19:56.958
Thanks, I'll do just that.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.333
But dang, that felt great.

00:20:01.833 --> 00:20:06.500
According to Mom,
that girl might be Kagome's daughter.

00:20:06.833 --> 00:20:10.583
Oh, my. So that means she's our relative!

00:20:10.583 --> 00:20:12.375
She might be, yes.

00:20:12.375 --> 00:20:16.292
Then it'll be fine if they
stayed here for a while, right?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.542
I don't mind.

00:20:18.542 --> 00:20:23.000
Yay! I have three older sisters now!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.000
Come on, just accept it already.

00:20:26.417 --> 00:20:29.000
She had that much demon power.

00:20:29.417 --> 00:20:33.500
She can't be lying about
being your older twin sister.

00:20:34.083 --> 00:20:37.375
I don't have any memories
of when I was younger.

00:20:37.708 --> 00:20:41.250
Besides, it's not something
I can simply accept.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:46.167
There is no way someone who indulges
in slumber like that can be my sister.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.167
I knew it.

00:20:49.833 --> 00:20:52.750
You've never fallen asleep before, have you?

00:20:54.083 --> 00:20:55.417
Bull's eye.

00:20:56.042 --> 00:20:58.958
Falling asleep leaves you
wide open to attack.

00:20:58.958 --> 00:21:01.292
It's common sense in the warring age.

00:21:01.292 --> 00:21:02.917
No, that's not it.

00:21:03.375 --> 00:21:06.417
It's not that you won't fall asleep.
You <i>can't </i>fall asleep.

00:21:07.292 --> 00:21:09.458
Don't act like you don't know.

00:21:09.458 --> 00:21:12.417
You got your dreams eaten
by the Dream Butterfly.

00:21:12.417 --> 00:21:14.917
My dreams were eaten?

00:21:16.917 --> 00:21:19.208
What an annoying curse.

00:21:19.333 --> 00:21:23.500
A butterfly in the dream world
has escaped over to this world,

00:21:23.667 --> 00:21:29.042
and now you can never fall asleep,
let alone ever have dreams again.

00:21:29.958 --> 00:21:34.250
<i>Setsuna can't fall asleep?</i>
<i>And she can't dream?</i>

00:21:35.083 --> 00:21:37.417
<i>But she was fine back then...</i>

00:21:38.208 --> 00:21:39.583
<i>All of this...</i>

00:21:39.583 --> 00:21:43.917
<i>It's all because </i>
<i>I let go of her hand.</i>

00:21:45.375 --> 00:21:48.250
<i>It's all my fault!</i>

00:21:49.042 --> 00:21:53.542
I bet you also tested the
resting moth's powder on yourself, right?

00:21:54.583 --> 00:21:57.125
And you have no
memories of your childhood

00:21:57.125 --> 00:22:00.333
because they were also stolen
by the Dream Butterfly.

00:22:00.542 --> 00:22:02.542
And what of it?

00:22:02.958 --> 00:22:06.167
In the warring age,
it works to my advantage.

00:22:06.167 --> 00:22:07.375
Hey...

00:22:07.375 --> 00:22:08.333
Setsuna!

00:23:43.958 --> 00:23:48.875
Moroha plans to negotiate with Root Head
to pass through the corridor of time.

00:23:48.875 --> 00:23:50.792
It's a pretty wild idea.

00:23:50.792 --> 00:23:53.792
But for Setsuna to be able
to fall asleep and have dreams,

00:23:53.875 --> 00:23:56.667
we have to look for the Dream Butterfly
in the Feudal Era.

00:23:56.667 --> 00:23:58.917
However, we run into someone in the corridor.

00:23:58.917 --> 00:24:01.833
Is the Tree of Ages
supposed to look like a priestess?

00:24:01.833 --> 00:24:03.250
Who are you?

00:24:03.375 --> 00:24:06.583
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:</i>
"The Gateway to the Past"

00:24:06.583 --> 00:24:09.083
You've done well to come here,
Half-Demon Princesses.

00:24:09.083 --> 00:24:24.064
Daughters of Sesshomaru,
I have a request for you.
